<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78664" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παράπτομαι</span></b> , 
			Med.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>apply</i>, of
			ointments, <i><span class="en">
				Asclep.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.584
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				681
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				13.250
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				12.34
			</span></i> :—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χερσὶ παραπτομένα πλάτα</span>
			<i>fitted to</i> the hands, <i>plied by</i> the hands, dub. l.
			in <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				717
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. σανίδων</span>
			<i>fixed along</i> planks, <i><span class="en">
				Apollod.
				<u>Poliorc.</u>
				173.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>touch in passing</i> or <i>slightly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				66.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cleom.</u>
				37
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτοῦ δακτύλῳ π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.108
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>touch by mistake,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hippiatr.
				49
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>have dealings with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυναικὸς ἢ ἀνδρὸς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMag.Par.</u>
					1.2173
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>approach</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς εἰς τὸ νοσῶδες παρατροπῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Apollon.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				7.19.5
			</span></i>.</div>
